		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "噫——！又、又来——！",
			"emotion": "giggle"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（然后是脚心和趾缝，那是卡住的窄缝，一个缝一个缝地闻过去）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "rat",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 10,
